    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/pedicure-makeup-store/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Pedicure Makeup Store is a modern and luxurious multipurpose theme crafted specifically for beauty and wellness businesses. Whether you operate a nail salon, pedicure and manicure service, makeup studio, or spa center, this beautiful theme is designed to elevate your online presence. It’s also an excellent choice for cosmetology clinics, skincare specialists, hair care professionals, and wellness entrepreneurs, as well as massage therapy centers and organic cosmetics shops, looking for a refined digital showcase. With a clean, minimal, responsive, and retina-ready design, the theme ensures a stunning user experience across all devices, backed by secure, optimized code for fast-loading pages. Key features include customizable banners, product showcase sliders, animated sections, strategically placed CTAs, and dedicated testimonial sections to enhance engagement and conversions. The theme integrates seamlessly with Contact Form 7, WooCommerce, and Booking Calendar, making it effortless to manage client inquiries and sales. Built with Bootstrap layouts and an array of personalization options, the theme provides creative control and is translation-ready, making it perfect for launching any beauty-related venture, from a salon to a cosmetics store. The Pedicure Makeup Store beautifully combines elegant design with professional functionality, ensuring a captivating online platform that attracts and retains clients."
    },
